.jpg"}, {"id": 781573, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scgr2d.jpg"}, {"id": 781575, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scgr2f.jpg"}, {"id": 726465, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scfkjl.jpg"}, {"id": 726466, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scfkjm.jpg"}, {"id": 781572, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scgr2c.jpg"}, {"id": 781574, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/scgr2e.jpg"}], "slug": "mina-the-hollower", "storyline": "You play as Mina, a whip-wielding Hollower and visionary inventor. She receives a troubling letter from Baron Lionel, her longtime patron and the overseer of Tenebrous Isle. Mina\u2019s advances in Spark Technology brought power to the Isle for the first time many years ago, ushering in newfound prosperity for its citizens. But now, the Spark Generators have gone out, and foul play is suspected.\n\nYou will use a myriad of weapons and oddball trinkets to vanquish the monsters thwarting Mina\u2019s objective. Along the way, you\u2019ll unearth the deep, dark secrets concealed beneath the island's newfound prosperity.", "summary": "Mina the Hollower is a bone-chilling action-adventure game featuring classic gameplay and an 8-bit aesthetic in the style of Game Boy Color, refined for the modern era.\n\nQuick and deliberate 60fps action combat, captivating world design, and top-down adventuring combine in a nostalgic blend. Whip foes, burrow through the ground, and explore a pixel-perfect world in Mina the Hollower, a brand new game from the developers who brought you Shovel Knight!", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 19, "name": "Horror"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/mina-the-hollower", "videos": [{"id": 63900, "name": "Announcement Trailer", "video_id": "_Fx0aJCRRpE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_Fx0aJCRRpE", "title": "Mina the Hollower Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i